  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>The radiation pressure in case of complete absorption is given by,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>I</mi><mi>c</mi></mfrac></math>.</p><p>Therefore, the force will be,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>I</mi><mi>c</mi></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>A</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow><mi>A</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>36</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>600</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>06</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>cm</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math></p></blockquote>",
